# Workspace Context (minimal)

- Repos and dependency order are defined in `profile.json`. Do not guess repo layout.
- Always resolve paths via `Resolve-TicketRoot.ps1 -Ticket <id> -Json` rather than hardcoding.
- Search from the **affected repo path**. Wide Grep/Glob from the workspace root can time out on
  large monorepos.

Full map: `profile.json` `repos[]` plus the matching cards under `environments/` (the
ticket-router `docSet` names them for multi-repo tickets). Do not load them for single-repo tickets.
